  "guideOverviewText": "Mighty is a trick-taking card game for 5 players. The Declarer (1) and Friend (1) team up against the Defenders (3).",
  "guideBidding": "Bidding",
  "guideBiddingText": "• Each player declares how many point cards they will win\n• The highest bidder becomes the Declarer\n• The Declarer chooses the trump suit (Giruda)",
  "guideSpecialCards": "Special Cards",
  "guideSpecialCardsText": "• Mighty: Ace of Spades (strongest card)\n• Joker: Second strongest card\n• Trump: The suit chosen by the Declarer",
  "guideFriend": "Friend",
  "guideFriendText": "• The Declarer designates someone with a specific card as Friend\n• The Friend can hide their identity\n• Joker Call: Designate the holder of a specific 3 as Friend",
  "guideScoring": "Scoring",
  "guideScoringText": "• Point cards: A, K, Q, J, 10 (1 point each, 20 total)\n• Declarer team wins if they reach the target score\n• Winners get + points, losers get - points",
  "guideTips": "Tips",
  "guideTipsText": "• Mighty and Joker are always powerful\n• Use trump cards wisely\n• Identifying the Friend is crucial",
