  "sevenCardGuideOverview": "Game Overview",
  "sevenCardGuideOverviewText": "Seven Card Poker is a poker game for 5 players. Create the best hand using 5 of your 7 cards to win.",
  "sevenCardGuideDealing": "Card Dealing",
  "sevenCardGuideDealingText": "• Initially receive 4 cards (3 hidden, 1 open)\n• Receive one open card after each betting round\n• Make a hand with 5 of your final 7 cards",
  "sevenCardGuideBetting": "Betting Rules",
  "sevenCardGuideBettingText": "• Check: Pass without betting\n• Call: Match current bet\n• Raise: Increase bet amount\n• Fold: Give up the hand\n• All In: Bet all chips",
  "sevenCardGuideHands": "Hand Rankings",
  "sevenCardGuideHandsText": "1. Royal Straight Flush\n2. Back Straight Flush\n3. Straight Flush\n4. Four of a Kind\n5. Full House\n6. Flush\n7. Mountain (A-K-Q-J-10)\n8. Back Straight (A-2-3-4-5)\n9. Straight\n10. Three of a Kind\n11. Two Pair\n12. One Pair\n13. High Card",
  "sevenCardGuideTips": "Game Tips",
  "sevenCardGuideTipsText": "• Predict opponent hands from open cards\n• Avoid excessive betting without strong hands\n• Bluffing is also a strategy",
  "sevenCardGuideBonus": "Bonus Hands",
  "sevenCardGuideBonusText": "• Royal Straight Flush: 500 chips\n• Back Straight Flush: 300 chips\n• Straight Flush: 200 chips\n• Four of a Kind: 100 chips\n\nBonus hands earn bonus from all other players!",
  "hiLoGuideOverview": "Game Overview",
  "hiLoGuideOverviewText": "Hi-Lo is a variation of Seven Card Poker where the pot is split between the highest and lowest hand.",
  "hiLoGuideDealing": "Card Dealing",
  "hiLoGuideDealingText": "• Same dealing as Seven Card Poker\n• Make a hand with 5 of your 7 cards\n• Choose Hi/Lo/Swing after final betting",
  "hiLoGuideHiLo": "Hi/Lo Selection",
  "hiLoGuideHiLoText": "• Hi: Compete with highest hand\n• Lo: Compete with lowest hand\n• Swing: Challenge both Hi and Lo\n\n50% of pot goes to Hi winner, 50% to Lo winner.",
  "hiLoGuideLow": "Low Hand Rules",
  "hiLoGuideLowText": "• Only hands without straights/flushes qualify\n• Lower is better (A is lowest)\n• Best low: A-2-3-4-6\n• No pair hands are advantageous",
  "hiLoGuideSwing": "Swing Rules",
  "hiLoGuideSwingText": "• Split 7 cards into two 5-card hands\n• Must win both Hi and Lo to succeed\n• Success: Win entire pot\n• Failure: That portion goes to other winner",
  "hiLoGuideTips": "Game Tips",
  "hiLoGuideTipsText": "• Low cards like A-2-3-4 favor Lo\n• Swing is risky but rewarding if successful\n• Observe opponent cards for strategy",
  "hiLoGuideBonus": "Bonus Hands",
  "hiLoGuideBonusText": "• Royal Straight Flush: 500 chips\n• Back Straight Flush: 300 chips\n• Straight Flush: 200 chips\n• Four of a Kind: 100 chips\n\nBonus hands automatically win the entire pot!",
